        "TileImage": "$($repository 825a0653-d5a3-468f-b07e-c1eebe9d8f68).Image",
        "Description": "The intel gatghered from our previous target and former client suggests that Chit has hired 3 agents to sabotauge the race in Miami, Florida. They will be doing their best to kill all of the racers competiting, meaning that we have to elimate them before the race is over. They are doing this in an attempt to create Chit Chaffeur Supremecy (CCS). We need to stop them, before they monopolise the automobile market with the only product being Chars (Chit Cars).\r\rGo get it, 47. The Chit awaits.",
